  "body": "Positioned in the heart of sought-after Orakei, this substantial solid concrete apartment offers an exceptional lifestyle of space, security and effortless low-maintenance living. Privately set behind a concrete wall and electronic gates, the residence enjoys sweeping panoramic views across the Waitemata Harbour and Auckland's iconic skyline.\r\n\r\nStep through the striking floor-to-ceiling entrance door onto beautiful solid timber floors that flow through a welcoming hallway. Generous 9-foot stud heights enhance the sense of light and scale throughout, while an internal lift provides seamless access to the lower levels where the triple lock-up garage and laundry are located.\r\n\r\nDesigned for easy single-level living, the apartment accommodates two generous bedrooms, including a well-appointed guest suite with its own ensuite, along with a separate powder room for visitors. The master suite offers a peaceful retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and spacious ensuite.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and dual living areas create highly versatile spaces designed for both relaxed day-to-day living and sophisticated entertaining. A gas fireplace add warmth and ambience, while large sliding doors open to a north-west facing, louvre-covered deck - perfectly positioned to capture afternoon sun while framing the spectacular outlook. From here, take in breathtaking panoramic views stretching across the Auckland city skyline, the Waitemata Harbour, Mount Victoria and North Head - a stunning backdrop both day and night.\r\n\r\nThe building offers lift access and excellent functionality, with a spacious laundry featuring extensive storage, a central vacuum system, and an integrated fire alarm for added comfort and peace of mind. Completing the package is a secure triple lock-up garage within the gated basement, along with a large lockable storage room - perfect for seasonal items, sporting equipment, or hobbies.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a substantial lock-and-leave concrete residence in one of Auckland's most prestigious coastal suburbs, offering space, security, remarkable views and effortless living just minutes from the city.",
